	(text "Writing LEDs is easy, just choose the #\nLED you want to light and send that number\nin binary as the LED select signal.\nDisable all LEDs by sending B > 55\ne.g. #8 LED for 3rd array, 8*3=24=011000\ne.g. #0 LED for 1st array, 0*1= 0=000000\nThe only caveat is that the #11 LED for the \n2nd and 4th array (only arrays with 11) are\ncalled with 50 and 51, respectively."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 89.916 198.374 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.651 1.651)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
